        "le",
        "les",
        "los",
        "lo"
      ],
      "correct": 1,
      "explanation": "A tus padres = several people: les.",
      "optionNotes": [
        "Le is for one person.",
        null,
        "Los is the direct pronoun (them), not “to them”.",
        "Lo is the direct pronoun (him, it)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a2-grammar-indirect-object-pronouns-1-03",
