        "he dicho le",
        "la he dicho"
      ],
      "correct": 0,
      "explanation": "The pronoun goes before haber: no le he dicho.",
      "optionNotes": [
        null,
        "Nothing goes between haber and the participle.",
        "The pronoun goes before haber, not after the participle.",
        "With decir, the person who is told is an indirect object: le."
